OL,3,GNEWSASocial worker tells tribunal
OL,4,Asacking was retaliation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA social worker who brought an unfair
OL,7,Fdismissal claim against the States
OL,8,FEmployment Board told a tribunal police
OL,9,Fconsidered criminally investigating
OL,10,Fher.
OL,12,FAlison Renouf was dismissed after she
OL,13,Fshared a video of a safeguarding
OL,14,Fmeeting with two charities which the
OL,15,Fboard argued breached her obligations
OL,16,Fof confidentiality.
OL,18,FIn her opening statement, Renouf
OL,19,Fclaimed officials "repudiated" the
OL,20,FIndependent Jersey Care Inquiry, an
OL,21,Finvestigation into decades of child
OL,22,Fabuse.
